-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003241_280736640614427_2079450943404390005_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RWmvvNaNJqUQ7kNvwG6gfT6&_nc_oc=AdlTVLy_czT40LaClNj7R_B_J5vNSfoUBjKDLDxfgfEopVq5-hWgupNJe5nFvWsQ2eA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwAhWegQBhwiK8g61sf_CWC1rxHoELFaFiCNoOijvn6lg&oe=69B2B875"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_5.png", "id": "697956894520220", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031440_697956901186886_5235259129555712544_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o61JBzyNqlkQ7kNvwEJncnq&_nc_oc=Adm3QXyVIWG-7q-s31Vpxvu5FcWqJE4GJjLEGnC7JrR5ZJDZSoTMY4IBmS8FL9L_ozE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyAUfqfZS0YdqziThAHYMpanM90Dbvtns0qQ2DaBykiLg&oe=69B2AC44"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Querformat.png", "id": "4779750352059112", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035406_4779750362059111_808409654242061204_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nMXF5rsAhvoQ7kNvwGvgdOI&_nc_oc=AdnLXenxLnf_Q9wgKUUW8bLCCR4OD21Uq8VEnwQ-XyIVNA1vW6tH1Dz9JShPYT6hpQ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzGIZmhzsF6O3y13zREiMUWnViXmcq0yMvexHqcytXQrg&oe=69B29FBE"}, "display_name": "Virtual Kitchen", "keywords": [], "long_description": "To make the training of the 110 apprentices of the KWP (Consortium of Viennese Retirement Homes) as modern and varied as possible, we developed a VR application around the topic of \u201cmeat\u201d: Where does it come from? How is it processed? And above all: What does responsible handling of this food look like? After all, a schnitzel \u201cdoesn\u2019t come into the world vacuum-packed in the supermarket,\u201d as KWP chef Peter Haidbauer sums it up in our case video.\n\n", "short_description": "Bon appetite! We bring apprentice chefs into the virtual kitchen to teach them how to responsibly handle meat."}]}, "developer_name": "Junge R\u00f6mer"